    "sections": {
        "changelog": "<h4>3.3.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>fix: odoo api function bridge patches</li>\n<li>feat: plugin screenshots</li>\n<li>feat: update readme and plugin official url</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.3.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>feat: introspection api</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "description": "<p>Bridge your WordPress forms without code, add custom fields, configure a workflow and make your data flow to your backend.</p>\n<h3>Integrations</h3>\n<p>Integrations are well known plugins that add forms to WordPress. We do bridges, let them do the forms and then work together to make your business work with ease.</p>\n<p>Forms Bridge has integrations with:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/contact-form-7/\" rel=\"ugc\">Contact Form 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.gravityforms.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GravityForms</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wpforms.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WP Forms</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/ninja-forms/\" rel=\"ugc\">Ninja Forms</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/woocommerce\" rel=\"ugc\">WooCommerce</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Addons</h3>\n<p>Forms Bridge comes with free addons. Each addon adds to the plugin new bridges to work with specific APIs, new workflow jobs and bridge templates.</p>\n<p>Forms Bridge has core support for generic REST API bridges and addons for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.bigin.com/developer/docs/apis/v2/?source=developer\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Bigin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developers.brevo.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Brevo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wiki.dolibarr.org/index.php/Module_Web_Services_API_REST_(developer)\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Dolibarr</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://somit.coop/financoop/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FinanCoop</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://workspace.google.com/products/sheets/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Google Sheets</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developers.holded.com/reference/api-key\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Holded</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://listmonk.app/docs/apis/apis/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Listmonk</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mailchimp.com/developer/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">MailChimp</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.odoo.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Odoo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.zoho.com/developer/rest-api.html\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Zoho CRM</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Docs</h3>\n<p>Browse the plugin&#8217;s documentation in our <a href=\"https://formsbridge.codeccoop.org/documentation/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">official website</a></p>\n<h3>Links</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://formsbridge.codeccoop.org/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Forms Bridge plugin page</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://git.coopdevs.org/codeccoop/wp/plugins/bridges/forms-bridge/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Gitlab</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.codeccoop.org\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Còdec</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/codeccoop/#content-plugins\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Other plugins</a></li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Bridge your WordPress forms without code, add custom fields, configure a workflow and make your data flow to your backend.",
    "description": "<p>Bridge your WordPress forms without code, add custom fields, configure a workflow and make your data flow to your backend.</p>\n<h3>Integrations</h3>\n<p>Integrations are well known plugins that add forms to WordPress. We do bridges, let them do the forms and then work together to make your business work with ease.</p>\n<p>Forms Bridge has integrations with:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/contact-form-7/\" rel=\"ugc\">Contact Form 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.gravityforms.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GravityForms</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wpforms.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">WP Forms</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/ninja-forms/\" rel=\"ugc\">Ninja Forms</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/woocommerce\" rel=\"ugc\">WooCommerce</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Addons</h3>\n<p>Forms Bridge comes with free addons. Each addon adds to the plugin new bridges to work with specific APIs, new workflow jobs and bridge templates.</p>\n<p>Forms Bridge has core support for generic REST API bridges and addons for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.bigin.com/developer/docs/apis/v2/?source=developer\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Bigin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developers.brevo.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Brevo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wiki.dolibarr.org/index.php/Module_Web_Services_API_REST_(developer)\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Dolibarr</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://somit.coop/financoop/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FinanCoop</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://workspace.google.com/products/sheets/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Google Sheets</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developers.holded.com/reference/api-key\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Holded</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://listmonk.app/docs/apis/apis/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Listmonk</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mailchimp.com/developer/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">MailChimp</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.odoo.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Odoo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.zoho.com/developer/rest-api.html\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Zoho CRM</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Docs</h3>\n<p>Browse the plugin&#8217;s documentation in our <a href=\"https://formsbridge.codeccoop.org/documentation/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">official website</a></p>\n<h3>Links</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://formsbridge.codeccoop.org/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Forms Bridge plugin page</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://git.coopdevs.org/codeccoop/wp/plugins/bridges/forms-bridge/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Gitlab</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.codeccoop.org\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Còdec</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/codeccoop/#content-plugins\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Other plugins</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
